[{"title":"望匡庐","author":"林光","text":"五老皤然出逶迤，知君相候亦多时。\n十年不尽今朝意，数首空留点画诗。\n秋月春花谁合主，丹房翠壁醉何疑。\n扁舟左蠡频回首，云掩千年白鹿祠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51244,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"筠州鞭春日偶成","author":"林光","text":"阛阓童儿笑语频，昨闻官府又迎春。\n好山在处都宜我，淑气今朝已着人。\n鸾镜未应羞黑发，鸠藤聊此领间身。\n阿谁更有狂如我，共向筠州一问津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51245,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春日游碧落山","author":"林光","text":"何处山光到酒频，今朝碧落始逢春。\n穿云返照留醒眼，饱雪疏松煞爱人。\n二老不饶惟白发，千金难买是闲身。\n自歌自笑扶青玉，来用来休更锦津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51246,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答陈贰教","author":"林光","text":"咄咄书空数岁频，梅花四十指头春。\n膏肓泉石终惭我，大雅声光却望人。\n木榻可辜千里梦，绨袍能恋百年身。\n朝来听得筠人语，流水桃花有别津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51247,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕前三日阅戊戌历","author":"林光","text":"骄阴断送过冬频，黄纸新开得早春。\n甲子巧当元日脚，屠酥偏待少年人。\n杖藜俯仰难供世，行几跏趺称病身。\n料理太平堪击壤，鹃声何敢到天津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51248,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留别子颖","author":"林光","text":"不须黄白语繁频，且共斟量曲米春。\n锦水谢虚西一席，罗浮远饷独归人。\n泥途不厌经冬蛰，泉石何疑向老身。\n尽任龙钟深取醉，夕阳回首杳行津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51249,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冷庵为陈粹之佥宪","author":"林光","text":"老蛰安冬不露辉，此庵宁与此翁违。\n三更白月常留照，九夏晴霜也自飞。\n何处炎炎堪炙手，此中默默已无机。\n宜春短褐还飘洒，曝背何妨爱晚晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51250,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"云尽山空独远寻，一桐难觅是知音。\n行行更过长桥去，耳不聋人在碧岑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51251,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"绿树森森野照明，荷风荡漾布帆轻。\n幽轩坐睡非难觉，只欠黄鹂三两声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51252,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"相如题桥","author":"林光","text":"会得真虚不是虚，乾坤随处总如如。\n凭谁寄语题桥子，何必还过驷马车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51253,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题渔图","author":"林光","text":"渔翁方手网，渔子就青波。\n脱或吞舟过，看渠又若何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51254,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢陈粹之佥宪惠语类欧文唐诗品汇","author":"林光","text":"稠叠颁分几案盈，穷儿暴富可胜情。\n滥觞此日嗟文字，老眼馀谁敢秤评。\n博约的知遵鲁叟，疏慵深恐负先生。\n石亭一瓣当西席，便合低头拜使星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51255,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"林光","text":"瑰石怪而奇，古木秃而瘦。\n翛然着此君，天地得三秀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51256,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登滕王阁","author":"林光","text":"江南绝景闻童阁，四十年来此一登。\n春及青山他自好，霜欺短发我何能。\n三王伟迹人争壮，万里双眸此更凝。\n野服岂须愁急雨，柳风吹面醉腾腾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51257,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪山小景","author":"林光","text":"门外青溪溪外山，逐云飞去逐云还。\n打鱼烟艇休撑去，留载山僧一段闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51258,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢欧阳玘医时会头疮","author":"林光","text":"白疥相将秃此童，佛头螺子碧丛丛。\n今朝眼底看蝉蜕，谢得南昌七十翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51259,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和祈大参致和将出巡阻雨见寄三首 其一","author":"林光","text":"断送骄阴好是难，一春寒似一冬寒。\n使君画舫须料理，万顷波涛正渺漫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51260,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和祈大参致和将出巡阻雨见寄三首 其二","author":"林光","text":"千红万紫欲开难，终日斜斜雨雪寒。\n安得晴无云一点，步随春水看弥漫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51261,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和祈大参致和将出巡阻雨见寄三首 其三","author":"林光","text":"几许相逢欲话难，一樽还解辟春寒。\n深杯莫厌罗浮味，千里云山易渺漫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51262,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏公圃","author":"林光","text":"潦倒烟霞得此身，一瓢吾敢怨吾贫。\n又携东莞青藜玉，来吊南昌鬻屦人。\n畦叶春深交翡翠，藕花风暖散茵陈。\n缄书果解酬知己，青草王孙几度新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51263,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永新谭节妇","author":"林光","text":"白刃前头叱一言，舅姑今得见黄泉。\n皇天自解知人意，母子分明在血砖。\n胡羯腥风吹海内，丈夫臣仆几城边。\n寻常一妇网常击，万古精神尚凛然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51264,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒徐孺子次石斋韵三首 其一","author":"林光","text":"面面湖光水镜寒，一丘垂老足盘桓。\n冥鸿阅世终辞缴，白刃临头几见冠。\n南亩有情拚独力，西山无数共谁看。\n故人谢得常留榻，三复应难露肺肝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51265,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒徐孺子次石斋韵三首 其二","author":"林光","text":"松竹摩挲对夕阳，东湖亭上吊荒亡。\n清风南国千年在，片碣开元只眼光。\n田野自能容此老，湖山终不爱名香。\n焦头烂额支颠厦，陈窦何曾纪太常。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51266,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒徐孺子次石斋韵三首 其三","author":"林光","text":"到处耕庸亦不悲，巢栖穴处尚谙时。\n三秋异卉终难好，一柱颓波别有裨。\n当宁叠能崇礼数，四山元亦托心知。\n生刍迢递来今日，一瓣名香孺子祠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51267,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题蓝关拥马图","author":"林光","text":"老凤孤鸣骇豕羵，元和无复别莸熏。\n山堆碧玉前当马，天设琼林此送君。\n精魄已开衡岳障，化机将变岭南云。\n飘飘可是来湘子，兴丧而翁验片文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51268,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将谒徐孺子","author":"林光","text":"百年湖海留双脚，每每思登孺子亭。\n小酌几时逢好日，北风吹雨又冥冥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51269,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过陈国宾园亭","author":"林光","text":"偶过东湖日未斜，满城谁是辟疆家。\n寻常杯酒还来此，指点春风几树花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51270,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赏瑞香和杜醉老","author":"林光","text":"春杯吾欲挽西江，况有天香傍玉缸。\n醉眼换将醒眼看，题诗还得笔如杠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51271,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题幽贞四咏卷","author":"林光","text":"走笔题诗每欲欢，九原情况和终难。\n何人却有丹青手，写出幽贞卷上看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51272,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题西湖醉老卷","author":"林光","text":"天地颓然一醉翁，眼拚花着耳拚聋。\n却疑南浦频频酒，还记催诗入卷中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51273,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"豫章留别陈粹之佥宪","author":"林光","text":"石亭留滞两旬间，南浦西来面一湾。\n又趁蒲帆投五岭，敢将藜杖薄西山。\n寒风往往疑正雨，短发垂垂愧病颜。\n谢得章江门外路，使君曾为几偷閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51274,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刚峰","author":"林光","text":"芗城放出千寻碧，鬼斧曾经百炼来。\n历历星霜终不改，棱棱霄汉老崔嵬。\n风云变态知何限，花草荣枯又几回。\n目断罗浮峰四百，为渠天际重徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51275,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明五云阻风过萧氏庄","author":"林光","text":"断阻狂风走逆沙，五云郊外步桑麻。\n惊心惶恐滩头水，着眼清明节里花。\n诗就带云眠野草，酒醒和叶嚼生茶。\n行行不觉边廛市，失记村庄历几家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51276,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别梁光岳","author":"林光","text":"舴艋长牵溯逆流，春风追送几濒头。\n他年记取南安路，莫误今朝是广州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51277,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"林光","text":"老树交加叶半空，山禽各各岭东风。\n披图指点春消息，欲为罗家一折中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51278,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盘窝观笋","author":"林光","text":"苦竹惊看几笋抽，满前生意不曾休。\n信知一部羲爻易，底用寻行数墨求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51279,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧庄观盘鱼","author":"林光","text":"洋洋相逐几鱼儿，盆里观来不似池。\n万顷澄波清见底，南溟翻忆钓鳌时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51280,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醒庵","author":"林光","text":"曲蘖生香满小糟，看君不饮果然高。\n我亦如今醒不得，任教终日醉陶陶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51281,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上十八滩","author":"林光","text":"逆境甘心不作难，南风终见北风还。\n昨宵篷底茶园梦，今日扁舟十八滩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51282,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西隐寺","author":"林光","text":"一樽随处弄云烟，点破沙门几许禅。\n野服又临西隐寺，南风留得赣州船。\n浮生未了空王梦，灌木仍开小洞天。\n惆怅郁孤台上酒，不知何日更留连。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51283,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望郁孤台","author":"林光","text":"两河山势叠相催，突兀城头露翠堆。\n木履可宜官府地，春风深负郁孤台。\n双眸向老终嫌窄，笑口于今几浪开。\n转盼又临清远峡，一樽留待上飞来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51284,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蒙泉书屋","author":"林光","text":"引得清清抱小轩，沙泥不许混真源。\n千峰精魄藏山腹，万斛珠玑喷石根。\n育德频年深大象，濯缨满耳咏诸孙。\n虎跑龙井都差别，肯向罗湖吝一言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51285,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王半山韵十八首 覆叠题九首 其一","author":"林光","text":"折腰辞长吏，结社许沙门。\n宦海诸人溺，颓波一柱存。\n桑麻春自满，蜂鸟日相喧。\n恬却奔波梦，栖栖只故园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51286,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王半山韵十八首 其二","author":"林光","text":"柴桑归汲汲，幽思向谁言。\n流水长随步，青山自绕门。\n肩舆僧社月，草座野人樽。\n指点重阳菊，丛丛又满园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51287,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王半山韵十八首 其三","author":"林光","text":"区区贪献玉，足刖枉沽裳。\n且任横肱睡，何妨举世忘。\n陶陶春酒后，洒洒竹风凉。\n午梦醒香茗，扶藜过小冈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51288,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王半山韵十八首 其四","author":"林光","text":"是山都指点，绝景更搜寻。\n敢道无佳似，终须遇赏音。\n青精浇白水，短发付长吟。\n红紫看无了，莺声又绿阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51289,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王半山韵十八首 其五","author":"林光","text":"一泓凝不乱，独爱看真源。\n白日人稀少，中年眼未昏。\n葛蕉居士服，杖屦榄山村。\n紫豆银茄种，如今灌渐繁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51290,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王半山韵十八首 其六","author":"林光","text":"疾风馀毁瓦，疏竹尚迎门。\n贫识人情改，寒思士屋温。\n一瓢终易足，四壁也难存。\n浩荡春光满，何山不故园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51291,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王半山韵十八首 其七","author":"林光","text":"松阴横一枕，翻忆在扶胥。\n铜鼓回春梦，波罗集异乌。\n于今甘拙讷，不睡复何如。\n九鼎传东汉，休云一钓扶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51292,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王半山韵十八首 其八","author":"林光","text":"潇洒东皋路，登临亦不时。\n先生拚屡醉，花鸟任相怡。\n翠带垂千柳，金梭掷一鹂。\n踟蹰归路晚，凉月浸西陂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51293,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王半山韵十八首 其九","author":"林光","text":"清风时一洒，默坐听渔歌。\n蚊蚋何曾炒，烟霞敢自多。\n一竿持白月，万顷钓晴波。\n兹事还堪领，将衣制芰荷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51294,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王半山韵十八首 其十 怀古","author":"林光","text":"瓶空无贮粟，松菊在名园。\n秫酒浇时变，乌巾到老存。\n北窗元自在，三径绝烦喧。\n一任儿曹懒，清风自扫门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51295,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王半山韵十八首 其十一","author":"林光","text":"每每亲秋菊，欣欣涉晓园。\n班荆罗父老，披褐倒杯樽。\n春换青丝柳，山深白板门。\n懒将贪睡息，屡屡向人言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51296,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王半山韵十八首 其十二 歌眠","author":"林光","text":"掩耳无多事，支颐就小床。\n梦恬香篆细，酒醒布衾凉。\n白月天留照，浮云世易忘。\n仓皇那浪起，颠倒着衣裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51297,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王半山韵十八首 其十三 山行","author":"林光","text":"藜杖何曾吝，浮云只自阴。\n春花方蓓蕾，天地与歌吟。\n自尔穷幽兴，何须问赏音。\n钟期双耳孔，千古杳难寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51298,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王半山韵十八首 其十四 即事","author":"林光","text":"山静人希到，春深花自繁。\n鸠藤行处酒，烟火望中村。\n偶尔逢耕叟，迟回话夕昏。\n不知天壤内，何处是桃园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51299,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王半山韵十八首 其十五 经故居","author":"林光","text":"青藜时领步，偶过旧栖园。\n梁燕语相认，春风迹尚存。\n尧天终共覆，孔席不曾温。\n贫病翻疑我，区区扫一门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51300,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王半山韵十八首 其十六 昼寝","author":"林光","text":"香醪堪日醉，伏枕免人扶。\n白昼心无事，清贫病恪如。\n沈沈甘朽木，忽忽走金乌。\n役税均明府，门无炒吏胥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51301,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王半山韵十八首 其十七 东皋","author":"林光","text":"低回滕伞岭，怅望曲龙陂。\n花气盈双袖，春声转数鹂。\n老亲那作恶，稚子巧相怡。\n尽日穷清赏，春光未暝时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51302,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王半山韵十八首 其十八 露坐","author":"林光","text":"滴露凝疏竹，香风递远荷。\n科头南海月，绝耳虎门波。\n僻地栖来惯，清宵得处多。\n老怀凉不寐，听得采莲歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51303,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题白沙节母受旌卷","author":"林光","text":"总贺风声树一门，如斯母子白沙村。\n却怜败壁寒帏下，多少贞婺欠此恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51304,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶书","author":"林光","text":"贫极糟妻不怨煎，双亲菽水渐安然。\n空山环堵秋光满，可值千金几觉眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51305,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"开户","author":"林光","text":"云掩重关久不开，草深行径竹穿台。\n山空夜静炉烟歇，且放中秋月又来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51306,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题","author":"林光","text":"黄沙蚬子贱如泥，赤鲤青鲇价总低。\n日饮两杯家酿熟，阁徐经史又山溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51307,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伤竹三首 其一","author":"林光","text":"嫩箨新移不耐吹，狂风拜舞久离披。\n归来欲把墙高筑，不是嫌他冷眼窥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51308,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伤竹三首 其二","author":"林光","text":"墙角风稍醉未醒，卷心虫叶瘦伶俜。\n相看孰忍持斤斧，雨洒烟催不暂停。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51309,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伤竹三首 其三","author":"林光","text":"青青叶子是何藤，弱竹稍头散玉绳。\n亦为先生添一赏，只愁风雨重加增。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51310,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句三首 其一","author":"林光","text":"童草歌喉按转新，深杯延醉日频频。\n试留醒眼斜阳外，谁到离披不丧真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51311,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句三首 其二","author":"林光","text":"寻行数墨祇昏尘，百涅千磨转畏人。\n狂药浇狂还不谢，百年回首莫伤神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51312,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句三首 其三","author":"林光","text":"半点阳和也自微，更呼残梦五更时。\n芳菲已夺游人魄，曾咏他年一句诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51313,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扉二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"童年俛仰及中年，一默真甘直万钱。\n不觉春山又春鸟，疏松老竹作冬眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51314,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扉二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"莺啼燕语自年年，春及侬家不用钱。\n满户游丝花在网，醒时看竹倦时眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51315,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]